ed across the range; and the replayed landings mint nothing.”\n  - Why: Evidence remains the sole home of test-function names; the method retains every verification arm in capability voice and preserves both range qualifiers.\n\nBuilder change list: none. No additional rows or cells required amendment.\n\nChecks:\n\n- `check_trajectory.py --strict` — exit 0; `check_trajectory: clean`.\n- `trace.py --strict` — exit 0; `orphans=0 integrity=0`.\n- Pytest skipped as directed.\n\nNo decomposition round; no hat outcomes apply."}}
